{"id":"wb-5-355","name":"永泰寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永泰寺塔","text":"永泰寺塔位于中国河南省登封市少林街道嵩山西麓，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n永泰寺始建于北魏正光二年（521年），初名“明练寺”，唐神龙二年改称永泰寺。古代遗物仅存寺塔、均庵主塔、肃然无为普同之塔及碑刻，余为现代重建。永泰寺塔建于唐代，为十一级密檐式砖塔，平面呈正方形，底边长5.05米，高24米。均庵主塔建于金大安元年（1209年），为四角二级砖塔，高3米余。肃然无为普同之塔建于明崇祯十一年（1638年），为喇嘛式砖塔，高6.18米。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E6%B3%B0%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93683096,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93683096","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/970c7e59b9330c7528a2e79c.jpg","title":"20250608_Pagoda_of_Yongtai_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250608_Pagoda_of_Yongtai_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/20250608_Pagoda_of_Yongtai_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​登封永泰寺塔","width":320,"height":480},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}